    37	
    38	- Multi-dimensional contact segmentation by role × sector × geography (KBM REQ-M004)
    39	- Custom contact role taxonomy depth (KBM REQ-M006)
    40	- Sector classifications (KBM REQ-M007)
    41	- Transactional vs. marketing email distinction with automatic subscription management (KBM REQ-M009)
    42	- Personalized email sending from individual user accounts (KBM REQ-M011)
    43	
