_Unification/working/pivot-brds-md/Financial_Management.md:308:Pivot's commission structure is based on project profitability, but commission calculations must use quoted/selling costs from sales orders rather than actual costs to avoid penalizing sales representatives for operational inefficiencies beyond their control\. This creates a requirement for dual GP calculations:
