   100	
   101	### D-4. Industry-specific KPIs (dual GP tracking and 360 dashboards)
   102	
   103	**Source:** Pivot REQ-3.02.02, REQ-3.02.03, REQ-3.02.06 (`Business_Intellegence.md` §3.02); KBM REQ-026, REQ-027 (`BRD_BusinessIntelligence_v1.0.md` §7)
   104	
